WEBVTT

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:35.270
The Hidden Leaf Village is 
finally starting to cool off.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.650
<b>Culture Festival</b>

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:36.240
<b>Leaf Village Council</b>

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:36.580
It's that time again...

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:39.030
Yes! The culture festival!

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:44.520
Looks like the Hokage will be here.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:47.330
Now you're talking.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:50.110
Boy, this is so fun!

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.840
Enjoying yourself, Sai?

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.690
What's wrong? Got a stomachache?

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.180
Sai!

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:00.470
We're at the culture festival!

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:02.380
Get excited! Have fun!

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:04.350
That's too excited...

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.270
You're right.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.600
It must be fun being the 
center of attention.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:12.440
I could never do it like you, though.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:18.090
Is Sai always like that?

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:20.560
Not particularly...

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:22.200
Something's up.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:26.000
Maybe he's upset about something?

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.460
<b>I'm Sai's New Agent!</b>

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.170
I've got it!

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.530
Got what?

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.890
I know what Sai's upset about!

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.060
Sai doesn't really stand out.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:50.560
So when he sees everyone 
focusing on me,

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.660
he wishes he could be the same way.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.860
No way!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.640
And people only pay attention
because you act like an idiot!

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:01.760
It's possible.

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.630
That's how Sai feels?

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.240
Chalk up two more idiots...

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.450
We have to find a way to make...

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:12.280
...Sai the center of attention 
at this culture festival!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:15.210
<b>Culture Festival</b>

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:13.080
Yeah!

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:15.210
What is going on here?!

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:19.920
Okay, Sai, let's solve your problem!

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:25.990
<i>Doggies, doggies, 
they make the best pets.</i>

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:31.250
<i>Forget about cats, 
doggies are the best!</i>

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:36.550
<i>Go out for a walk,
all around the block!</i>

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.040
Bands are culture festival staples.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.110
Do well and you're sure to stand out!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.850
Now for our next song!

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.570
Wh-What?

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:47.400
What the heck is that?!

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.600
His normal look is a little plain,

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:50.910
so I used some stage makeup.

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.650
"Some"?

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:56.530
There's so much I can't 
even tell it's him!

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.130
Let's rock!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.630
I'll show you!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.430
I can't really see Sai...

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:09.760
The three of them stand out too much!

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:12.060
Listen to my guitar!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:15.560
Listen to my punchline!

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.480
Boo!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.990
Sai, we're just starting!

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.950
Starting what?

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:35.740
You fools crashed our stage.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:45.610
The crowd wasn't into our 
hard-rocking passionate song...

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.360
Buncha philistines.

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:50.750
You guys were awful!
Don't make excuses!

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.120
No one could possibly enjoy that noise!

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:56.980
Exactly. You've gotta give 
the fans what they want.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.430
What they want...

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:00.940
Tenten, you're brilliant!

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:03.840
Place your orders here!

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:07.490
When you want to relax, 
you head for a café!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:10.580
The waiters and waitresses are
the flowers of the festival!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.160
He's sure to stand out here.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:15.550
You might be right.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:20.730
Why are they maids?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.190
Naruto, show him how it's done!

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.040
Yeah!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.730
Welcome home, Master―

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:32.750
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.220
Klutz.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:40.190
The waitresses here are all people
who couldn't make it as idols.

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:46.140
The plan here is to turn a flaw into
an asset and get popular that way!

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:47.910
You're making enemies 
of maids everywhere!

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.910
Okay, go for it, Sai.

00:05:57.780 --> 00:06:00.000
If places like this make you happy...

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.920
...you must lead pretty pathetic lives.

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:08.630
Now all of Akihabara's your enemy!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:12.390
Look at Sai's emotionless smile!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.390
It's the same fake smile you 
get from fast food joints!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.600
Welcome.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.860
That's not a compliment!

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:22.290
And now you've turned the 
whole world against you!

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.900
Forget this place!

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:25.920
C'mon!

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.260
Take care.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.110
Hey, you jerks...

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:33.120
Why're you insulting my customers?!

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:38.290
There must be a way to use 
Sai's natural traits...

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.410
...to make him stand out.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.790
Natural traits...

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:44.290
Of course.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.260
<b>Haunted House</b>

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.260
<b>Sponsored by 
the Ninja
Academy</b>

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.630
Looks like it worked.

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:54.250
Sai's ghostly paleness...

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:57.310
...and barely-noticeable
presence are perfect in here.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.350
This is your idea of standing out?!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.000
And why are you running away?!

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.650
See? He's the center of attention.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.710
I guess that's true...

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:15.240
But...

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:18.310
He's so scary, everyone left!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:23.840
So you guys are the reason
we've got no more customers!

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.000
We worked so hard to build this place!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.650
Konohamaru...

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:29.090
We...

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.510
Leave me alone!

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:37.930
I don't understand what you're doing,

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.710
but can you please leave me out of it?

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.290
Sai, wait up!

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.190
Sai!

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:45.950
From where I stand,

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:49.530
you're a lazy man who won't even
try to solve his own problems!

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.660
Are you comfortable with someone 
thinking that about you?!

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:56.860
To solve a problem,

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:58.700
you have to charge forward,

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:00.870
and hit it head on without 
 fear or trepidation!

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:07.890
You're right.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:09.670
I'll do just that.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.560
Yes, that's the spirit!

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:16.140
I'd like to take part in this.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.560
<b>Momotaro</b>

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.560
Performance
by the
Hokage

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.130
Here, have a dumpling.

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:27.510
We've done nothing but butt in today.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:29.730
I'd prefer you say "sneak" in.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.430
I'm off to fight the ogres!

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:36.040
We'll be taking the lead role.

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.080
We're not sneaking anywhere!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.930
Look at us, we're out 
on the main stage!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:45.300
I'm off to fight the monsters!

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:48.590
You four are the real monsters!

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:54.680
We've finally made it.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:55.420
Yes.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:59.560
Countless people sacrificed
themselves so we could get this far.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:02.270
You guys were the ones behind all that.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.160
Well met, Momotaro!

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:11.050
What're you doing here?

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:14.720
We defeated the fake Momotaro.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:15.860
I see.

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.700
So you're saying you're 
here to interrupt my play.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.200
Let's go, guys. For Sai!

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:22.800
Rasengan!

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:25.750
Eight Trigrams Air Palm!

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:28.360
Leaf Whirlwind!

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.560
All right, Lady Tsunade!

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:34.300
This is so not Momotaro anymore...

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:36.270
We're not done...

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:38.970
Time for our secret team super move!

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:44.510
A new move? It looks strong!

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:46.350
Here we come!

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:49.610
Weak!

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.660
The main character's still there...

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:55.770
Super Beast Scroll!

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:03.910
Rogue ninjas!

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:04.950
When did they―

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.090
Shoot, they saw us?

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.770
Those rogues infiltrated the village.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:17.390
I noticed them while 
you and the others...

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:18.840
...were dragging me around, Lee.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:21.690
Since they were looking 
for Lady Tsunade,

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.310
I did as you told me.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.270
I charged forward and hit them head on,

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:26.730
without fear or trepidation.

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:30.000
I-I completely overlooked them...

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:32.230
Excellent job.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:45.980
Sai, I'm so very sorry 
for calling you lazy.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.210
And hey, you really 
stood out back there!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.460
What's that supposed to mean?

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.240
Oh, come on!

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:57.980
You wanted to be the center
of attention just like me, right?

00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.940
No, not really.

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:03.930
Actually I was worried about 
what kind of annoyances...

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.870
...you were going to make me suffer.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:07.180
A-Annoyances?

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:10.390
But, well...

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.400
I wouldn't say it wasn't fun.

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.050
Sai...

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:26.370
So we went through all that
because of a misunderstanding?!

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:30.260
Damn it!

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:35.840
We all have our good 
points and bad points.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:40.920
But everyone has the potential 
to take the lead role.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:50.390
When you're out there enjoying 
the culture festival,

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:52.690
don't forget about the after 
party on the last night!

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.420
Where should we go next?

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.020
What's wrong, Lee?

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.820
I...

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.360
I have to do this.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:13.920
<b>The Mr. 
Leaf Village 
Contest</b>

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:13.920
The main event of the final night<i>!!</i>

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:13.920
Win two tickets 
to a five-star 
restaurant!

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:11.890
The Mr. Leaf Village Contest?

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:15.150
Win two tickets to a 
five-star restaurant?

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.850
Sakura, your eyes are more
beautiful than the night sky.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.150
Oh, Lee...

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.050
Hold it.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.220
Naruto?

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.650
You can't have her.

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:33.560
Then it's a match.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:35.150
Yup.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.030
Oh boy.

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:39.110
Aren't you gonna enter, Neji?

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:39.790
I―

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.660
If Neji enters, it'll become 
the "Miss" Leaf contest!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:42.330
What?!

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:43.380
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:47.230
With all that cross-dressing 
you do, you'd be a shoe-in!

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:49.970
What?!

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:51.610
That tears it!

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:56.370
I'll show you two that 
I'm a man amongst men!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:04.470
<b>Win Lady Tsunade's Heart!</b>

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:06.890
And we're underway!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.470
The first Mr. Leaf contest!

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:11.650
Here are our contestants:

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:14.780
Choji, Neji, Naruto, and Lee!

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:16.770
What're you doing here, Choji?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.880
I want the prize, duh.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.890
Our theme is, of course,
"A man I'd like to date!"

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:25.610
Good luck to you all, gentlemen.

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:29.090
The first event is fashion!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:32.590
What would you wear on a first date?

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:36.330
A first date should be 
casual, but stylish.

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:38.990
You're up, Choji.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:39.870
Right!

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:45.720
Not bad at all.

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:51.220
Well, we did spend a week finding
the perfect XXL-sized outfit.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.720
Sounds troublesome...

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:55.070
Next, Neji.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:57.390
I'm not a slave to the latest trends.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.400
It's so non-trendy it's traditional!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.600
Well, Lady Tsunade?

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:06.570
I'd think he'd be more at home in
a kimono than a hakama skirt.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.530
Not again...

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.490
N-Naruto, it's your turn!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:16.210
My research tells me "natural" is
the way to go for a first date!

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:22.460
That's not the kind of "natural" 
you want to go with...

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:26.570
This is less natural and 
more back-to-nature.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.390
And what a scrawny body on him.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:30.180
Scrawny?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.430
F-Finally, we have Lee.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:40.320
On a first date, wearing a leggy ant
outfit will impress your date.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.290
<b>Leggy Ant</b>

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:43.110
It's not "leggy ant,"
it's "elegant!"

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.110
<b>Elegant</b>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.930
A pun... and a bad one.

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:49.110
Everyone except Choji
ended up as the butt of a joke.

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:51.700
So cold...

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.560
Next is the pick-up!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:59.720
Guys, how do you ask a girl out so that
she can't help but say, "Okay"?

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:01.290
Your target is Lady Tsunade herself!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.960
Wanna check this place out with me?

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:07.650
All-you-can-eat cake at 
a really famous bakery.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:09.280
Well played!

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:12.890
Choji's banking on the fact that
most girls love a sweet treat!

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.270
Okay.

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:18.670
Wow, I figured Choji would suggest 
getting Korean barbecue.

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:23.590
He actually almost bought 
all-you-can-eat BBQ tickets at first.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:25.400
But then I thought about it.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:28.360
First I entered a talent contest.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.740
Whoa, whoa, what does this 
have to do with food?

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.950
I had my debut, got popular,

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:38.020
and ended up getting the street in
front of the BBQ place closed off.

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:39.500
A live street show?!

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:41.930
Since the restaurant 
couldn't get supplies,

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:43.450
they had to close for the day,

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:47.240
and Choji had no choice but to go 
to the bakery next door instead.

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:50.140
I have no idea what just happened,

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:51.970
but an IQ of 200 is something else...

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.800
Next up is Neji!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.060
Lady Tsunade, I'll be 
waiting at the gates.

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:58.000
Please accept these.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.780
Neji opts for a direct strike!

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:03.580
What a huge bouquet!
Thank you very much!

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:07.040
Yes, one rose for each 
year of your age.

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:08.760
In other words, fifty―

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:10.820
You don't need to say it!

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:13.570
Forget the sissy flower games!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:17.490
All you gotta do is look 
her dead in the eyes.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.250
Sunday.

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:22.110
You and me...

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:23.460
Ah, forget it.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:26.730
I can't get into it when it's 
just you, Granny Tsunade.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.550
All those wrinkles under your eyes.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:29.420
<b>Wrinkles</b>

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:31.170
Look into her eyes, not under them!

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:33.090
That's terrible, Naruto!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:36.430
I'll show you how to get 
a woman to say yes!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:40.480
Lady Tsunade, will you train
with me on our next day off?

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:43.590
I don't care if you're 
fifty-four and have wrinkles!

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:46.050
As fellow singles, we can overcome
the age gap with enough hard work!

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:47.650
I know we―

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.690
You're killing her...

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:56.370
<b>Single           Wrinkles</b>

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.360
L-Lady Tsunade!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:55.430
You didn't get an "okay," 
you got a "KO!"

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:56.490
I'm sorry...

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:59.330
It's time for a ten-minute break.

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:02.290
Come on, Lee, are you even serious?

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.510
That was horrendous.

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:05.800
I...

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:08.550
I'm giving it my all, I swear.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:12.260
But now I'll never be Mr. Leaf!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.220
Lee...

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.600
What kind of man gives 
up and starts crying?

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.700
If you don't stick to your guns,

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.450
you'll never manage to date Sakura!

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:27.350
Tenten...

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:29.890
That..

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:31.970
That was awesome!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:34.090
Don't get snot on me!

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:36.070
Tenten, you're so cool!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.740
Get away!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.740
Gross, gross!

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:44.700
The final event is "confessions."

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:46.840
It's the end of the first 
date, admit how you...

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:48.710
...really feel and win the woman's heart!

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:51.670
And I'm your girl.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.160
Choji, you're up first.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.240
Right!

00:18:04.010 --> 00:18:05.100
Um...

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:10.060
I know this sounds cheesy, 
but would you...

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:15.760
Would you eat barbecue with me every
day for the rest of our lives?!

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:18.440
Y-You stink...

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:22.970
Oh no, a blast of bad breath 
at the critical moment!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:25.900
Shikamaru, you didn't prep 
anything for him this time?

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.150
Nah, too troublesome.

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:30.460
Everything you did for the last two 
events was totally troublesome!

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:33.900
My restaurant tickets...

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.720
You've gotta be more 
romantic than that.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.970
Have at it, Neji!

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:41.490
We need to talk.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:43.240
Yes?

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:46.040
Would you be mine forever?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:48.940
Yes.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:51.580
There's something important 
you need to do...

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.040
...to become part of the Hyuga clan.

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:55.480
I made a quick mock-up.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:58.480
Well?

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.370
You need to have the same face?!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:05.610
It's true that everyone in the 
Hyuga clan looks the same...

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.600
Th-That's bad?

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.650
When you're confessing your love,

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:10.830
don't act like a big shot.

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:13.210
Your turn, Naruto.

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:18.500
I've never had a girl over before.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:22.890
So I was hoping... you know...

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:25.730
I-Is this a dust rag?

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:27.520
We'll wipe up the table 
with this first―

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.790
Actually that's a dirty sock.

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:32.860
Gross!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:33.800
Forget it.

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:36.320
Come on! If you love someone,

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.000
you shouldn't care about their dirty laundry!

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:41.320
How naive of you, Naruto.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.780
The most important thing...

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:47.370
...is to always stick with your 
woman, no matter what!

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:49.420
What're you doing?!

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:52.920
Tenten told me to stick to my guns.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.590
Not that kind of sticking, I'm sure!

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:58.760
I'll stick by you, and love you every day!

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:02.430
Disgusting!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.720
Girls hate clingy guys, Lee!

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:12.170
We'll just have to determine 
the winner right here.

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.240
Yeah.

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:14.490
Fine by me!

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:16.610
Lady Tsunade!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:18.530
Please...

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:20.780
...go out...

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:24.370
...with me!

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.860
You idiots!

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:37.750
What have you done
to Lady Tsunade?!

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:39.960
Lady Tsunade!

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.380
I'm fine.

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.580
Thank goodness...

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:50.380
And now for the results.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:52.100
Mr. Leaf Village is...

00:20:58.390 --> 00:21:00.070
Mister...

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.490
...Tenten!

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:05.950
M-Me?!

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:09.650
After all she's done to protect me,

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:11.550
I'd definitely rather date Tenten.

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:17.590
And so, I award Tenten with two tickets
to the "Heaven's Doorstep Restaurant!"

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:20.750
Th-That's so random...

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.930
As for you four...

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:32.490
I've got a special 
prize for all of you.

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:35.030
My fists!

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.000
Don't feel bad.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:44.990
Lee and the boys ended up right by the
Heaven's Doorstep Restaurant, too.

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:23.790
Next week is "Gaara's First Crush!"

00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:25.840
<b>Gaara's First Crush!
A Gift From Orochimaru!</b>

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:25.840
and "A Gift From Orochimaru!"

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:29.080
Wasn't Gaara just here?

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.760
Is it okay for him to leave 
his village so often?

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.880
The Sand Village has it 
rough, too, you know.

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:35.420
They just set up his new work visa.

00:23:35.420 --> 00:23:36.640
Work visa?

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.680
So he's here on a mission?

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:41.750
No. There's nothing 
out there but desert.

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:44.840
Maybe he's here to earn money
and send back remittances?

00:23:44.840 --> 00:23:46.420
The Kazekage working on the road?!

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:50.180
Stop casually insulting the 
Sand Village like that!
